<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta content='text/html; charset=UTF-8' http-equiv='Content-Type' />
    <style>
      body { font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f7f9fc; margin: 0; padding: 0; color: #333; }
      .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
      .header { background-color: #10b981; padding: 30px 20px; text-align: center; color: white; }
      .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; }
      .content { padding: 30px; }
      .content p { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; }
      .tracking-box { background-color: #f0fdf4; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 25px 0; text-align: center; }
      .tracking-number { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; color: #059669; letter-spacing: 2px; margin: 10px 0; }
      .footer { background-color: #f1f5f9; padding: 20px; text-align: center; color: #64748b; font-size: 14px; }
      .btn { display: inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; background-color: #10b981; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 10px; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <h1>Your Order is on the Way! 🚚</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="content">
        <p>Hi <%= @order.name %>,</p>
        <p>Great news! Your order <strong>#<%= @order.id %></strong> has been shipped and is on its way to you.</p>
        
        <p><strong>Shipping to:</strong><br>
        <%= @order.address %></p>

        <div class="tracking-box">
          <p style="margin: 0; color: #047857; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 1px;">Estimated Delivery</p>
          <div class="tracking-number"><%= @order.estimated_delivery_date&.strftime("%A, %b %d") || "Within 3-5 Business Days" %></div>
          <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #065f46;">Via Standard Courier Service</p>
        </div>

        <p>Click the button below to view your full order details and track its live status on our website.</p>

        <div style="text-align: center;">
          <%= link_to 'Track Order', order_url(@order), class: 'btn' %>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="footer">
        <p>If you have any questions, reply to this email or contact our support.</p>
        <p>&copy; <%= Time.current.year %> Larry Commerce. All rights reserved.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
